# Autonomy

Workflow rules live in `AGENTS.md` (Delivery workflow). In short: run spec → tests → code → verify →
review → PR without waiting for a thumbs-up. Escalate only for a game-design question that SPEC.md and the
refined issue don't answer, a substantial unexpected cost (any backend, paid service or new account), or
a big behaviour shift versus SPEC.md or a shipped packet.
